<div id="content" class="single">
<div id="post-header" class="">
      <h1 id="title">5 Small Language Models for Agentic Tool Calling</h1>
  <p class="excerpt">
     Here are 5 small language models that hare one important trait: they all support structured tool calling in a compact, open-weight package.
  </p>
	
     <div class='author-link'>By <strong><a href="https://www.kdnuggets.com/author/matt-mayo" rel="author">Matthew Mayo</a></strong>, KDnuggets Managing Editor on May 14, 2026 in <a href="https://www.kdnuggets.com/tag/language-models">Language Models</a></div>  
	<div style="height: 45px;">  <!---->
<!-- -->
<!-- <div class="addthis_native_toolbox"></div> -->
